`tried in a District Court` MEANS `State Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
    `the offence is to be tried in a District Court` IS TRUE
    `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS FALSE

`tried in a Magistrate's Court` MEANS `State Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
    `the offence is to be tried in a District Court` IS FALSE
    `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS FALSE

`must be tried in the High Court` MEANS `High Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
    `the offence must be tried in the General Division of the High Court` IS TRUE
    `the Public Prosecutor designates the General Division of the High Court to try the offence` IS FALSE
    `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS FALSE

`designated for the High Court` MEANS `High Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
    `the offence must be tried in the General Division of the High Court` IS FALSE
    `the Public Prosecutor designates the General Division of the High Court to try the offence` IS TRUE
    `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS FALSE

